<div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 no-mar documents shadow-box news-new-box" >  
  <div class="news-head">
    <div class="text-center black-title">
      <h3 class="ghead">  ಇತ್ತೀಚಿನ ಸುದ್ದಿ</h3>
    </div>
  </div>  
<!-- <a href="" class="ribbon-sm">Read All News</a> -->
<div id="" class="">
  <div class="news-in" behavior="scroll" direction="left">
                        <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1788334872.pdf">Implementation of the Directive relating to Reduction in Demand Charges to HT Industrial Consumers in cases of Power Outages beyond the Specified Limits in a Month – Reg.</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/48811787813645.pdf">ಕರಡು ಕವಿನಿಆ (ವಿದ್ಯುಚ್ಛಕ್ತಿ ಸರಬರಾಜು) ವಿನಿಯಮಗಳು (ಇಎಸ್ಆರ್), 2026</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/33531787573519.pdf">ಮುಖ್ಯಾಂಶಗಳು: ಕರಡು ಕರ್ನಾಟಕ ವಿದ್ಯುಚ್ಛಕ್ತಿ ನಿಯಂತ್ರಣ ಆಯೋಗ (ವಿದ್ಯುಚ್ಛಕ್ತಿ ಸರಬರಾಜು) ವಿನಿಯಮಗಳು (ಇಎಸ್‌ಆರ್), 2026</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/34211787573519.pdf">Highlights of the changes proposed in the Draft KERC (Electricity Supply Regulations) (ESR) 2026 compared to the existing Conditions of Supply of Electricity (CoS), Recovery of Expenditure (RoE) and other Regulations relating to supply of electricity.</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/48561787653428.pdf">DSPV Generic tariff 25.08.2026</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1787642381.pdfhttps://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1787642381.pdfhttps://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1787642381.pdfhttps://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1787642381.pdfhttps://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1787642381.pdfhttps://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1787642381.pdfhttps://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1787642381.pdf">KERC DSPV Plants Regulations, 2026</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/12121787573621.pdf">Draft Karnataka Electricity Regulatory Commission Electricity Supply Regulations,2026</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1786969012.pdf">Inviting Comments on Draft KERC Electricity Supply Regulations ESR, 2026</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/92521786601976.pdf">Public Notice on Hampapura Power Transmission Limited petition for Transmission Licensee</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/59951786601976.pdf">Public Notice on Mekhali Power Transmission Limited petition for Transmission Licensee</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/423/_gallery_/en">Application for Grant of Transmission Licensee by Mekhali Power Transmission Limited</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/422/_gallery_/kn">Application for Grant of Transmission Licensee by Hampapur Power Transmission Limited</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/92921785748077.pdf">Public Hearing on Draft KERC Connectivity and General Network Access to the Intra State Transmission and State Distribution System Regulations 2026</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/media_to_upload1783685034.pdf">Order In the matter of Implementation of Automatic Meter Reading AMR facilities for Generators and Associated Measures</a></p>            <p><i class="fa fa-hand-o-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <a href="https://kerc.karnataka.gov.in/uploads/74101782984978.